<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to <%= appName %></title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            color: #1f2937;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1 0%, #a855f7 100%);
            padding: 48px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .logo-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 40px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .intro {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 500;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .feature-box {
            background-color: #f3f4f6;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .checklist {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .checklist li {
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .check-icon {
            color: #10b981;
            margin-right: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .cta-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px 0;
            border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;
            margin-top: 32px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #6366f1;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 16px 32px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 12px 0;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        .button-secondary {
            background-color: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #6366f1;
            color: #6366f1;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 32px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #6b7280;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background-color: #e5e7eb;
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .social-links {
            margin-top: 16px;
        }
        .social-links a {
            color: #6b7280;
            text-decoration: underline;
            margin: 0 8px;
        }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                margin: 0;
                border-radius: 0;
            }
            .header, .content, .footer {
                padding: 32px 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo-text"><%= appName %></div>
            <h1>You're officially on the list.</h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <p class="intro">Thanks for joining <%= appName %>.</p>

            <p>We're building a <strong>private marketplace</strong> where verified travelers guess the hotel's secret price to win the room.</p>

            <p>Unlike public discounts, hotels never reveal their minimum price—so they can fill empty rooms without hurting their brand.</p>

            <div class="feature-box">
                Today, a handful of independent hotels are already accepting bids, and we're adding more every week.
            </div>

            <p>As we grow, you'll be the first to know when:</p>
            <ul class="checklist">
                <li><span class="check-icon">✓</span> New hotels join</li>
                <li><span class="check-icon">✓</span> Launch parties</li>
                <li><span class="check-icon">✓</span> Exclusive discounts</li>
            </ul>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p><strong>Ready to play?</strong></p>
            <p>Browse the hotels already accepting bids.</p>
            <a href="<%= marketplaceUrl %>" class="button">→ Start Bidding</a>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <h3>Follow the journey</h3>
            <p>We're documenting the launch in real time.</p>
            <a href="<%= instagramUrl %>" class="button button-secondary">→ Follow us on Instagram</a>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <h3>One favor</h3>
            <p>Is there an independent hotel you'd love to see on <%= appName %>?</p>
            <p>Simply forward this email to the owner or GM—or introduce us directly. Every hotel that joins makes the marketplace better for everyone.</p>
            <a href="<%= referHotelUrl %>" class="button button-secondary">→ Refer a Hotel</a>

            <p style="margin-top: 48px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;">Let's goooo!<br>Elvina</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p><%= appName %> — Life is short. Travel now.</p>
            <div class="social-links">
                <a href="<%= marketplaceUrl %>">Website</a>
                <a href="<%= instagramUrl %>">Instagram</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
